---
<Layout title="Shipping — Good Apollo Goods" description="Shipping information for Good Apollo Goods hats.">
  <PageHero eyebrow="Help / Shipping" title="From the studio to you." intro="Every order ships from the Good Apollo Goods studio in Grand Rapids, Michigan." />
  <section class="container info-grid"><h2>What to expect</h2><div><h3>Completed small batches</h3><p>Only finished pieces marked Available can be purchased. Processing and delivery estimates will be shown at checkout.</p><h3>Coming-soon pieces</h3><p>Preview pieces are not available for purchase. New completed batches are released periodically in limited quantities.</p><h3>Rates and tracking</h3><p>Available services, shipping rates, and tracking details will be confirmed during checkout.</p></div></section>
</Layout>
